  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "イリマから　あずかった　ノーマルＺ。\nしげみのどうくつ　おくにある\nだいざに　おくよう　たのまれた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "일리마에게 받은 노말Z.\n우거진 동굴 안쪽에 있는\n대좌에 두도록 부탁받았다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "伊利馬交給你的一般Ｚ。\n有人拜託你把它放到\n蔥鬱洞窟深處的台座上。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une Normazélite qu’Althéo vous a confiée. Il vous\na demandé de la déposer sur le piédestal qui\nse trouve au fond de la Grotte Verdoyante.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das Normium Z, das Elima dir anvertraut hat.\nEr hat dich gebeten, es in den Sockel in der\nVegetationshöhle zu legen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Normastal Z que te entrega Liam para que lo\ndeposites sobre el altar situado al fondo de la\nCueva Sotobosque.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Normium Z ricevuto da Liam. Devi porlo\nsul piedistallo dentro la Grotta Sottobosco.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The Normalium Z you were entrusted with by Ilima.\nYou were asked to place it on the pedestal at\nthe back of Verdant Cavern.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "イリマから　預かった　ノーマルＺ。\n茂みの洞窟　奥にある\n台座に　置くよう　頼まれた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "伊利马交给你保管的一般Ｚ。\n受人嘱托要把它放到\n葱郁洞窟深处的台座上。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
